{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792098180, "covers_from": "2026-10-15T21:03:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-15T21:04:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792098240, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-15T21:03:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 18807, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "我孩子北上在台北市工作，住文山區秀明路二段，每天上班要到中山北路，早上七點就要出門，期待政大捷運快通", "display_name": "文山代表 No.18,807", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T21:03:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 53120, "sprite_key": "penguin_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "教育", "content": "我一直挺綠，但簡議員的行為真讓人感到噁心、太超過了，黃校長與主任們都以校為家，不要抹滅他人的辛苦！！", "display_name": "大安代表 No.53,120", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T21:03:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 49682, "sprite_key": "deer_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "其他", "content": "這個介面的音樂很好聽，加油加油！", "display_name": "大同代表 No.49,682", "mood": "positive", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T21:03:36+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 52834, "sprite_key": "turtle_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "其他", "content": "台北市政府在近年內執行了網際網路的網域更改自“.tp.gov.tw”至”.taipei”。請改回來！", "display_name": "士林代表 henghsin 恆新", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T21:03:51+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 22520, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "交通", "content": "台北捷運在月台層的冷氣 常常都很悶\n希望可以在改善", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.22,520", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 53120, "sprite_key": "penguin_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.53,120", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 49682, "sprite_key": "deer_oldtown", "display_name": "大同代表 No.49,682", "district": "datong", "is